#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:288
msgid ""
"The :meth:`~object.__repr__` of :class:`ImportError` and "
":class:`ModuleNotFoundError` now shows \"name\" and \"path\" as "
"``name=<name>`` and ``path=<path>`` if they were given as keyword arguments "
