#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:884
msgid "Upgraded JIT compiler"
msgstr "Upgradovany JIT kompilator"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:886
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Results from the `pyperformance <https://github.com/python/pyperformance>`__"
" benchmark suite report `3-4% <https://github.com/facebookexperimental/free-"
"threading-"
"benchmarking/blob/main/results/bm-20251214-3.15.0a2%2B-6cddf04-JIT/bm-20251214-vultr-x86_64-python-6cddf04344a1e8ca9df5-3.15.0a2%2B-6cddf04-vs-"
"base.svg>`__ geometric mean performance improvement for the JIT over the "
"standard CPython interpreter built with all optimizations enabled. The "
"speedups for JIT builds versus no JIT builds range from roughly 20% slowdown"
" to over 100% speedup (ignoring the ``unpack_sequence`` microbenchmark) on "
"x86-64 Linux and AArch64 macOS systems."
msgstr ""
"Výsledky z benchmarkové sady `pyperformance "
"<https://github.com/python/pyperformance>`__ hlásí `3–4% "
"<https://github.com/facebookexperimental/free-threading-"
"benchmarking/blob/main/results/bm-20251214-3.15.0a2%2B-6cddf04-JIT/bm-20251214-vultr-x86_64-python-6cddf04344a1e8ca9df5-3.15.0a2%2B-6cddf04-vs-"
"base.svg>`__ zlepšení výkonnosti na geometrickém průměru pro JIT oproti "
"standardnímu interpreteru CPython sestaveném se všemi optimalizacemi. "
"Zrychlení pro sestavení s JIT vs. bez JIT se pohybuje od přibližně 20% "
"zpomalení až po více než 100% zrychlení (bez započtení mikrobenchmarku "
"``unpack_sequence``) na systémech x86-64 Linux a AArch64 macOS."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:896
msgid "These results are not yet final."
msgstr "Tyto vysledky jeste nejsou konecne."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:898
msgid "The major upgrades to the JIT are:"
msgstr "Hlavni upgrady JIT jsou:"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:900 ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:907
msgid "LLVM 21 build-time dependency"
msgstr "LLVM 21 zavislost na dobu stavby"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:901
msgid "New tracing frontend"
msgstr "Novy frontend sledovani"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:902 ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:931
msgid "Basic register allocation in the JIT"
msgstr "Zakladni prideleni registru v JIT"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:903 ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:940
msgid "More JIT optimizations"
msgstr "Vise optimalizaci JIT"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:904 ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:954
msgid "Better machine code generation"
msgstr "Lepsi generovani strojoveho kodu"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:908
msgid ""
"The JIT compiler now uses LLVM 21 for build-time stencil generation. As "
"always, LLVM is only needed when building CPython with the JIT enabled; end "
"users running Python do not need LLVM installed. Instructions for installing"
" LLVM can be found in the `JIT compiler documentation "
"<https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/main/Tools/jit/README.md>`__ for all"
" supported platforms."
msgstr ""
"JIT kompilator nyní pouziva LLVM 21 pro generovani sablon v dobe stavby. "
"Jako vzády, LLVM je potrebny pouze pþ stavbe CPython s povolenym JIT; "
"konecni uživatelé poustiteljici Python nepotrebují instalovane LLVM. Pokyny "
"pro instalaci LLVM naleznete v `dokumentaci JIT kompilator "
"<https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/main/Tools/jit/README.md>`__ pro "
"všechny podporovane platformy."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:915
msgid "(Contributed by Savannah Ostrowski in :gh:`140973`.)"
msgstr "(Prispelo Savannah Ostrowski v :gh:`140973`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:918
msgid "A new tracing frontend"
msgstr "Novy frontend sledovani"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:919
msgid ""
"The JIT compiler now supports significantly more bytecode operations and "
"control flow than in Python 3.14, enabling speedups on a wider variety of "
"code. For example, simple Python object creation is now understood by the "
"3.15 JIT compiler. Overloaded operations and generators are also partially "
"supported. This was made possible by an overhauled JIT tracing frontend that"
" records actual execution paths through code, rather than estimating them as"
" the previous implementation did."
msgstr ""
"JIT kompilator nyní podporuje vyrazne vice operaci bajtkodu a toku ridici "
"nez v Pythonu 3.14, umoznujici zrychleni na sirší skale kodu. Napriklad "
"jednoduche vytvoreni Python objektu je nyní chapano JIT kompilator 3.15. "
"Pretizene operace a generatory jsou tez caste podporovany. To bylo mozne "
"diky vylepseneho JIT sledovace frontendu, ktery zaznamenava skutecne cesty "
"provedeni skrz kod, spise nez je odhad jako to predchozi implementace."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:927
msgid ""
"(Contributed by Ken Jin in :gh:`139109`. Support for Windows added by Mark "
"Shannon in :gh:`141703`.)"
msgstr ""
"(Prispelo Ken Jin v :gh:`139109`. Podpora pro Windows pridana Mark Shannon v"
" :gh:`141703`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:932
msgid ""
"A basic form of register allocation has been added to the JIT compiler's "
"optimizer. This allows the JIT compiler to avoid certain stack operations "
"altogether and instead operate on registers. This allows the JIT to produce "
"more efficient traces by avoiding reads and writes to memory."
msgstr ""
"Zakladni forma prideleni registru byla pridana do optimalizacni hostedu JIT "
"kompilator. To umoznuje JIT kompilator vyhnout se jistym operacim stacku "
"uplne a miste toho pracovat s registry. To umoznuje JIT vytvarit "
"efektivnejsi stopy vyhybanim se ctenim a zapisy do pameti."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:937
msgid "(Contributed by Mark Shannon in :gh:`135379`.)"
msgstr "(Prispelo Mark Shannon v :gh:`135379`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:941
msgid ""
"More `constant-propagation "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Constant_folding>`__ is now performed. This "
"means when the JIT compiler detects that certain user code results in "
"constants, the code can be simplified by the JIT."
msgstr ""
"Vice `sireeni-konstant <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Constant_folding>`__ "
"je nyní provedeno. To znamena, ze kdyz JIT kompilator zjisti, ze jisty kod "
"uzivatele vyvola v konstanty, kod muze byt zjednodus JIT."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:945
msgid "(Contributed by Ken Jin and Savannah Ostrowski in :gh:`132732`.)"
msgstr "(Prispelo Ken Jin a Savannah Ostrowski v :gh:`132732`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:947
msgid ""
"The JIT avoids :term:`reference count`\\ s where possible. This generally "
"reduces the cost of most operations in Python."
msgstr ""
"JIT se vyhýba :term:`reference count` kde je to mozne. To obecne snizuje "
"cenu vetsiny operaci v Pythonu."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:950
msgid ""
"(Contributed by Ken Jin, Donghee Na, Zheao Li, Hai Zhu, Savannah Ostrowski, "
"Noam Cohen, Tomas Roun, and PuQing in :gh:`134584`.)"
msgstr ""
"(Prispelo Ken Jin, Donghee Na, Zheao Li, Hai Zhu, Savannah Ostrowski, Noam "
"Cohen, Tomas Roun a PuQing v :gh:`134584`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:955
msgid ""
"The JIT compiler's machine code generator now produces better machine code "
"for x86-64 and AArch64 macOS and Linux targets. In general, users should "
"experience lower memory usage for generated machine code and more efficient "
"machine code versus the old JIT."
msgstr ""
"Generator strojoveho kodu JIT kompilator nyní vytvarí lepsi strojovy kod pro"
" x86-64 a AArch64 macOS a Linux cíle. Obecne by uzivatele meli zazivatsi "
"použiti pameti pro vygenerovany strojovy kod a efektivnejší strojovy kod "
"proti stareu JIT."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:960
msgid ""
"(Contributed by Brandt Bucher in :gh:`136528` and :gh:`136528`. "
"Implementation for AArch64 contributed by Mark Shannon in :gh:`139855`. "
"Additional optimizations for AArch64 contributed by Mark Shannon and Diego "
"Russo in :gh:`140683` and :gh:`142305`.)"
msgstr ""
"(Prispelo Brandt Bucher v :gh:`136528` a :gh:`136528`. Implementace pro "
"AArch64 prisena Mark Shannon v :gh:`139855`. Dodatecne optimalizace pro "
"AArch64 priseny Mark Shannon a Diego Russo v :gh:`140683` a :gh:`142305`.)"

