msgid ":mod:`typing`:"
msgstr ":mod:`typing`:"

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-3.17.rst:34
msgid ""
"Before Python 3.14, old-style unions were implemented using the private "
"class ``typing._UnionGenericAlias``. This class is no longer needed for the "
"implementation, but it has been retained for backward compatibility, with "
"removal scheduled for Python 3.17. Users should use documented introspection"
" helpers like :func:`typing.get_origin` and :func:`typing.get_args` instead "
"of relying on private implementation details."
msgstr ""
"Pred Pythonem 3.14 byly unii se starou zemou implementovany pomoci soukrome "
"tridy ``typing._UnionGenericAlias``. Tato trida jiz neni potrebna pro "
"implementaci, ale byla uschodovana pro zpetnou kompatibilitu se sejmutim "
"naplanovano na Python 3.17. Uzivatele meli by pouzivat dokumentovane "
"introspektovaci pomocniky jako :func:`typing.get_origin` a "
":func:`typing.get_args` miste spouhania se na soukrome detaily implementace."

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-3.17.rst:39
msgid ""
":class:`typing.ByteString`, deprecated since Python 3.9, is scheduled for "
"removal in Python 3.17."
msgstr ""
":class:`typing.ByteString`, zastarala od Pythonu 3.9, je naplanovana na "
"odebrani v Pythonu 3.17."

