"Annotations are visible in ``/proc/<pid>/maps`` if the kernel supports the "
"feature and :option:`-X dev <-X>` is passed to the Python or Python is built"
" in :ref:`debug mode <debug-build>`. (Contributed by Donghee Na in "
":gh:`141770`)"
msgstr ""
