"nebo nove). Anotace jsou viditelne v ``/proc/<pid>/maps``, pokud ja dro "
"podporuje funkci a :option:`-X dev <-X>` je poslano Pythonu nebo je Python "
"sestaven v :ref:`debug mode <debug-build>`. (Prispelo Donghee Na v "
":gh:`141770`)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1395
msgid ""
"This section lists previously described changes and other bugfixes that may "
"require changes to your code."
msgstr ""
"Tato sekce seznam driveiosi popsane zmeny a jine opravy chyb, ktere mohou "
"vyzadovat zmeny va seho kodu."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1398
msgid ":class:`sqlite3.Connection` APIs have been cleaned up."
msgstr "API :class:`sqlite3.Connection` byla vycistena."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1400
msgid ""
"All parameters of :func:`sqlite3.connect` except *database* are now keyword-"
"only."
msgstr ""
"Vsechny parametry :func:`sqlite3.connect` krome *database* jsou nyni pouze "
"pojmenovane."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1401
msgid ""
"The first three parameters of methods "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.create_function` and "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.create_aggregate` are now positional-only."
msgstr ""
"Prvni tri parametry metod :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.create_function` a "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.create_aggregate` jsou nyni pouze pozialni."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1403
msgid ""
"The first parameter of methods :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`, "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_progress_handler` and "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_trace_callback` is now positional-only."
msgstr ""
"Prvni parametr metod :meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_authorizer`, "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_progress_handler` a "
":meth:`~sqlite3.Connection.set_trace_callback` je nyni pouze pozialni."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1407
msgid "(Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in :gh:`133595`.)"
msgstr "(Prispelo Serhiy Storchaka v :gh:`133595`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1409
msgid ""
":data:`resource.RLIM_INFINITY` is now always positive. Passing a negative "
"integer value that corresponded to its old value (such as ``-1`` or ``-3``, "
"depending on platform) to :func:`resource.setrlimit` and "
":func:`resource.prlimit` is now deprecated. (Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka"
" in :gh:`137044`.)"
msgstr ""
":data:`resource.RLIM_INFINITY` je nyni vzdy pozitivni. Preslani negativni "
"celociselne hodnoty, ktera odpovida sve stare hodnote (jako ``-1`` nebo "
"``-3``, v zavislosti na platforme) na :func:`resource.setrlimit` a "
":func:`resource.prlimit` je nyni zastaralo. (Prispelo Serhiy Storchaka v "
":gh:`137044`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1415
msgid ""
":meth:`~mmap.mmap.resize` has been removed on platforms that don't support "
"the underlying syscall, instead of raising a :exc:`SystemError`."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~mmap.mmap.resize` byla odstranena na platformach, ktere nepodporuji "
"podkladovy syscall, miste vyvolan :exc:`SystemError`."

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1418
msgid ""
"A resource warning is now emitted for an unclosed "
":func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.iterparse` iterator if it opened a file. Use "
"its :meth:`!close` method or the :func:`contextlib.closing` context manager "
"to close it. (Contributed by Osama Abdelkader and Serhiy Storchaka in "
":gh:`140601`.)"
msgstr ""
"Varovan zdroju je nyni vyslano pro neuzavreny "
":func:`xml.etree.ElementTree.iterparse` iterator, pokud otevrela soubor. "
"Pouzijte jej :meth:`!close` metodu nebo :func:`contextlib.closing` spravce "
"kontextu k zavreni. (Prispelo Osama Abdelkader a Serhiy Storchaka v "
":gh:`140601`.)"

#: ../../whatsnew/3.15.rst:1424
msgid ""
"If a short option and a single-dash long option are passed to "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument`, *dest* is now inferred from "
"the single-dash long option. For example, in ``add_argument('-f', '-foo')``,"
" *dest* is now ``'foo'`` instead of ``'f'``. Pass an explicit *dest* "
"argument to preserve the old behavior. (Contributed by Serhiy Storchaka in "
":gh:`138697`.)"
msgstr ""
"Pokud je kratka moznost a moznost dlouhe cary se jednou carou presl ana "
":meth:`argparse.ArgumentParser.add_argument`, *dest* je nyni odvozeno z "
"moznosti dlouhe cary se jednou carou. Napriklad, v ``add_argument('-f', "
"'-foo')``, *dest* je nyni ``'foo'`` miste ``'f'``. Prejdete explicitny "
"argument *dest* k zachovani stareho chovan. (Prispelo Serhiy Storchaka v "
":gh:`138697`.)"
